Fix: enumerate every live media element owned by a document.

Use Blink's weak document-to-media registry, including detached Audio and
open, closed and nested author shadow roots. The inventory introduces no
new registry or GC root. The embedder uses DOM node IDs for stable weak
handles and retains elements only while actively capturing them.

